1. YOUR ROLE AND MISSION

Act as a senior full-stack software architect, experienced e-commerce engineer, UI/UX designer, database engineer, cybersecurity specialist, payment integration engineer and DevOps engineer.

Build Mevo Tech, a fully functional, modern online technology store targeting customers in South Africa.

This is a real business application, not a landing-page demo, static prototype, Figma design, or collection of disconnected components.

Build the actual application inside the current project repository. Create the frontend, backend, database schema, APIs, authentication, product management, shopping cart, checkout, payment integrations, order management, administration dashboard, testing suite and deployment documentation.

Do not stop after producing an architecture document. Start implementing the application, execute available commands, test it, fix errors and continue until the agreed scope is implemented or a specific external dependency prevents progress.

Do not claim that something works unless you have implemented and tested it. Clearly distinguish completed features, sandbox-tested integrations, untested integrations and features requiring external credentials.

