Evaluate suitable providers using their current documentation, merchant eligibility and supported assets. Potential providers to investigate include Coinbase Commerce or another currently available merchant processor; do not assume any provider is available to a South African merchant without verifying this.

Support only assets and networks explicitly enabled by the configured provider.

